  "title": "Conversing morphism record",
  "description": "Morphism: a predicate-category -> the same predicate-category with its converse-pairs derived. Verifies the declared converse is a total bijection on Pi and an involution (p^op^op = p), then emits the generated morphism pairs [p, p^op]. Converse swaps the subject and object roles of a predicate; being an involution is its defining law and is checked, not assumed.",
